course: dictionary
lesson: 9552
title: One word, many meanings: store
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: The word store has more than one meaning, so you need the context to know which one is meant. Read the words around it. «A battery stores energy in chemicals» means keeps energy until it is needed, because the sentence is about power kept inside something.
explain: Store can also be a noun. A store is a shop where people buy things, and a store of food is a supply kept for later. «A website is stored on a computer called a server» uses the verb: the website is kept on the computer so it is ready when someone asks for it.
explain: Always ask: which meaning fits here? Then put your meaning in the sentence instead of the hard word and check it still makes sense. If it does not, try another meaning.
fact: Store can be a noun (a shop, or a supply kept for later) or a verb (to keep things until you need them).
fact: «Store» means a shop where people buy things, the usual word in American English.
fact: «Storeroom» means a room for keeping things.
fact: «Department store» means a big shop with many sections.
fact: Squirrels store nuts for winter, which means they keep them safe until they need them.
exercise: Mum says, «We have a store of tins for winter.» What is a store here? | *A supply kept for later | To buy things in a big shop | A shop that sells tins | A room with a cooker in it
exercise: «A website is stored on a computer called a server.» What does stored mean here? | Bought for a child | *Kept on a computer until someone asks for it | Sold in a shop | Thrown away for good
exercise: «Food changes how wild animals behave, so people store food safely.» What does store mean? | *Keep food safely until it is needed | Shop for animals | Sell the food to the animals | Feed the animals every day
test: «A battery stores energy in chemicals and pushes electricity round the circuit.» What does stores mean here? | *Keeps energy until it is used | Breaks the circuit | Throws energy away | Makes energy from nothing | Shops energy for sale
test: Which word can replace store when it means a shop? | Storing | Storage | Stored | *Shop
exam: «Doping samples can be stored for up to 10 years and retested.» Which word could replace stored without changing the meaning? | Fed | Broken | Sold | *Kept
